Grammar

    0 $accept: program $end

    1 program: ε
    2      | expr `;;` program
    3      | decl `;;` program

    4 expr: app_expr
    5      | `\` ID `.` expr
    6      | `\` `(` S_1 `)`
    7      | `let` decl `in` expr

    8 app_expr: app_expr const_expr
    9      | const_expr

   10 const_expr: NUM
   11      | CHAR
   12      | ID
   13      | `<` ID `,` `[` S_2 `]` `>`
   14      | `(` expr `)`

   15 pattern: const_expr `->` expr

   16 type_expr: type_expr_body
